<title>INDIA: POLL-India TELCO 1st half net seen down.</title>
<headline>POLL-India TELCO 1st half net seen down.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net profit of Tata Engineering and Locomotive Company Ltd (TELCO) is forecast to slip 8.6 percent to 3.0 billion rupees in the first half of 1997/98 (April-March), according to a Reuter poll consensus on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Sales are seen falling 2.9 percent to 45.3 billion rupees from 46.6 billion in the year-ago period, 18 leading brokerages and securities houses said.</p>
<p>TELCO is India's largest truck-maker. It also manufactures construction equipment.</p>
<p>Following are the details of the poll compared with actuals for the first half of 1996/97.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>				NET PROFIT		   SALES</p>
<p>				   (first half to September 30)</p>
<p>			    97/98     96/97	97/98	96/97</p>
<p>					 (in millions of rupees)</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>TELCO   ----PAT seen down 8.6%, sales 2.9%</p>
